Subject: Anuran roadside calling survey-- how to deal with ordinal outcome?
Message-ID: <NiVFQU3b1Pw.L52dj4hPCAAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/NiVFQU3b1Pw/m/L52dj4hPCAAJ>
