Emiliano,

This would not have had any effect on your actual model results, so no need to worry there. It was just a bug in the code for making the plot, the labels for the observations were not being sorted correctly. Also, this is fixed in the dev version of unmarked now:

https://github.com/rbchan/unmarked/commit/3cb0dbb0084384bc6ca6e3801e4da001030f84e0

Ken

